    "description": {
      "value": "<p>如果你拥有施法或契约魔法职业能力，通行龙纹表中的法术将加入你施法职业的法术列表中。</p>\n<table style=\"width:222.03pt;height:120px\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:66pt\"></col><col style=\"width:156pt\"></col></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height:20px\">\n<td class=\"et2\" style=\"height:20px;width:87px\">法术环位</td>\n<td class=\"et2\" style=\"width:207px;height:20px\">法术</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:20px\">\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"height:20px;width:87px\">1</td>\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"width:207px;height:20px\">脚底抹油，跳跃术。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:20px\">\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"height:20px;width:87px\">2</td>\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"width:207px;height:20px\">迷踪步，行动无踪。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:20px\">\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"height:20px;width:87px\">3</td>\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"width:207px;height:20px\">闪现术，魅影驹。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:20px\">\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"height:20px;width:87px\">4</td>\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"width:207px;height:20px\">任意门，行动自如。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:20px\">\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"height:20px;width:87px\">5</td>\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"width:207px;height:20px\">传送法阵。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>",
